-- The general style rules now come from site-runtime's WRITING_RULES (app/lib/ai.server.ts puts them in every
-- drafting system prompt), so ai.prompt.style keeps only germomics' own addition. Rewritten only if it was not edited live.
UPDATE settings SET value = 'Germomics house rule, on top of the writing rules above: no em dashes (the long dash character) anywhere; use commas, periods, parentheses, or colons instead.'
  WHERE key = 'ai.prompt.style' AND value = 'Writing style (strict): Do NOT use em dashes (the long dash character) anywhere; use commas, periods, parentheses, or colons instead. Do not end on a verdict about the episode''s worth or staying power (''stays with you'', ''remains one of the most''), and leave out blurb adjectives (unforgettable, haunting, sweeping, poignant, profound). No ''not just X, it''s Y'' and no ''it isn''t about X, it''s about Y''. A list of three only when there are three real things. Write plain, direct, varied, human sentences.';
